[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7262.79, "timestamp": "02:01:02", "text": "他们把钱退给了那个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7265.189, "timestamp": "02:01:05", "text": "然后他在推特上发了一条帖子，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7266.79, "timestamp": "02:01:06", "text": "《战争雷霆》里传来一阵尖叫声，就像这样："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7268.87, "timestamp": "02:01:08", "text": "你们这些人到底怎么了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7276.629, "timestamp": "02:01:16", "text": "因为他把资产变现了，所以拿到了2万美元。现在他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7278.79, "timestamp": "02:01:18", "text": "实际上他有2万美元。他必须付钱"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7279.613, "timestamp": "02:01:19", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hcMfY5_zAbbxvwKLooCoCA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7279.709, "timestamp": "02:01:19", "text": "税"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7282.83, "timestamp": "02:01:22", "text": "它。”哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7285.51, "timestamp": "02:01:25", "text": "上帝。如果他用……买了那些东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7287.189, "timestamp": "02:01:27", "text": "无论哪种情况，他都不必缴税。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7288.669, "timestamp": "02:01:28", "text": "为此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7291.109, "timestamp": "02:01:31", "text": "是的。为什么他们不能给他们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7293.83, "timestamp": "02:01:33", "text": "游戏内物品？但这只是一个游戏道具。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7296.31, "timestamp": "02:01:36", "text": "因为他们从来没有那些物品"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7298.149, "timestamp": "02:01:38", "text": "从未存在过。这是愚人节玩笑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7301.35, "timestamp": "02:01:41", "text": "开玩笑。啊，感觉就像你要去……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7305.43, "timestamp": "02:01:45", "text": "获得一张特别的金色狗狗卡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7306.109, "timestamp": "02:01:46", "text": "这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7310.03, "timestamp": "02:01:50", "text": "Doge 狗狗表情符号之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7312.709, "timestamp": "02:01:52", "text": "那。你将获得一张黄金通行证，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7314.95, "timestamp": "02:01:54", "text": "诸如此类的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7318.39, "timestamp": "02:01:58", "text": "而且它就像一个史诗级的表情包合集，"}]